      "translation": {
        "english_text": "After considering the arguments of both sides and examining the witnesses, Kumaran does not appear to be a revolutionary, an advocate of violence, or a reviler of God. Telling people to read, worshipping one God—such acts cannot make one a revolutionary or an advocate of violence! In these days when the government itself is taking steps to abolish zamindari, Kumaran has only struggled to restrain the zamindar's outrages. Therefore... Kumaran is released as not guilty.",
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "notes": []
      }
    },
